#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
aitools - AI Productivity, Quota Management & Workflow Automation Suite.
Multi-command, multi-agent, and multi-account CLI for AI engineers.

Capabilities:
  1. Quota & Telemetry Inspection (quota / watch):
     Inspects rolling quota windows, remaining %, and countdown timers across
     Antigravity (Gemini/Claude/GPT), Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, OpenCode, Pi, and LLM.
  2. Intelligent Model Wakeup & Priming (wake):
     Calculates exact reset times from telemetry (/usage, /status) to activate 5h
     rolling windows only when expired/idle, with fallback countdowns for blackbox tools.
  3. Wakeup & Hardware RTC Auto-Wake Daemon (daemon):
     Supervises RTC wakeups (e.g. 04:00 AM), verifies network, primes expired models,
     schedules next alarms, and auto-suspends in 12s to save power.
  4. AI Git Commit Pipeline (commit):
     Inspects staged diff and queries LLM (agy, claude, codex, opencode, pi, llm)
     to generate crisp Conventional Commit messages with interactive accept/edit/regenerate.
  5. Tooling Health Check (status):
     Verifies path availability, versions, and integrations across all AI CLIs.
"""

